WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.134
All right.

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:01.267
If you're

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:01.901
just joining us,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.303
