00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.238
out of California in Torrance,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.306
near Los Angeles.

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.273
A dramatic standoff

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.508
is now over after

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.310
police moved in on to White Vans

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.311
that were near each other.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.412
The vans fit a description

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.447
of a vehicle of interest in connection

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.249
with last night's deadly mass shooting

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.451
at a dance studio in Monterey Park.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.953
It is still unclear what,

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.521
if anything, police found

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.323
inside the two vans,

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.791
but you can see the officers

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.626
making their way into the vehicle.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:27.927
One of the vehicles,

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.262
the one vehicle of interest

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.498
where there appears to be a suspect

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:34.300
or maybe a suspect dead inside

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.469
on the driver's side of that vehicle.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.337
In the meantime, the L.A.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:38.071
County Sheriff's

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.339
Department, Special Enforcement

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.641
Bureau tweeted that their SWAT operation

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.243
for an armed suspect

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:45.045
in Torrance has concluded

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.746
neighborhoods safe.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:47.914
The tweet goes on to say,

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.049
and this is the suspect

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.250
that police are looking for.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.252
They believe he is responsible

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:52.819
for shooting

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.454
and killing ten people and injuring

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.655
at least ten others.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.656
In Monterey Park,

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.991
the victims were gathered

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:58.825
at a dance studio

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.126
