00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.294
Asian-American community

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.363
to celebrate the Lunar New Year.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:04.898
And I want to bring in

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.032
Jonathan Wackrow, CNN

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:06.599
law enforcement

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.700
